          "text": "**September 2025 cost activity review — read-only**\n\n- **Work order:** MO-25-09-1070 (`WO-2025-09-004`), Racine\n- **Source transaction:** `TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070` (INPUT / component issue)\n- **Amount:** **31,825,075 cents** ($318,250.75)\n- **Event created:** `2025-09-30T20:25:00`\n- **September period entered Pending Close:** `2025-09-30T18:00:00`\n- **Time after Pending Close:** **145 minutes** (2 hours 25 minutes)\n- **Recorded accounting status:** **POSTED**\n- **Status consistent with Oracle’s documented Pending Close treatment?** **No.** Oracle’s policy says newly created transactions that fall in or before a Pending Close period are not staged for Cost Accounting or Receipt Accounting until the period is closed or reopened. This component-issue event is not among the stated exceptions, so its recorded `POSTED` status is inconsistent with that treatment.\n\nThe review was read-only; no database records were changed. The report was submitted and verified.",
